<div class="about-content">
  <h2>About ULS Explorer</h2>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h3>What is ULS Explorer?</h3>
    <p>ULS Explorer is a web-based application designed to simplify access to the FCC Universal Licensing System (ULS) database. The FCC ULS is a comprehensive database containing information about licenses issued by the Federal Communications Commission.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h3>How it Works</h3>
    <p>This application provides a modern, user-friendly interface for querying the ULS database. Users can search for license information by various criteria and view detailed information about licenses and applications.</p>
    <p>The application is built using Node.js and Express, with a MySQL database backend.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h3>Project Status</h3>
    <p>ULS Explorer is currently under development. This is an early version with limited functionality.</p>
  </section>
</div>
